#==============================================================================================
#
#   fetch_record - Fetch::Infrastructure::FetchRecord: a fetch group's record of a request
#   and its fetch controller
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Fetch/Infrastructure/FetchRecord.cpp (lines 14-46) with the
#       inline members of FetchRecord.h (lines 25-29). A record leaves its FetchRecord::List
#       (an intrusive list) when it is finalized.
